      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>打印 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 行放大的 <span class=\"katex math inline\">Z</span> 。\n比如：\n<span class=\"katex math inline\">n=3</span> ，打印图形如下</p>\n<pre><code>***\n *\n***\n</code></pre>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">n=4</span> ，打印图形如下</p>\n<pre><code>****\n  *\n *\n****\n</code></pre>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">n=5</span>，打印图形如下</p>\n<pre><code>*****\n   *\n  *\n *\n*****\n</code></pre>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "打印 n 行放大的 Z 。\n比如：\nn=3 ，打印图形如下\n***\n *\n***\n\nn=4 ，打印图形如下\n****\n  *\n *\n****\n\nn=5，打印图形如下\n*****\n   *\n  *\n *\n*****"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n（n \\lt 10</span> ）</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "一个整数 n（n \\lt 10 ）"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>n行放大的Z。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "n行放大的Z。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>4</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>****\r\n  *\r\n *\r\n****</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>1</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>*</pre>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
